  "schema_version": 1,
  "scope": [
    "First original audio stream in track order, finite/unknown-sized segments/clusters, allthree lacing modes, packet ordering, full CodecPrivate, CodecDelay/OpusHead preskip, initial Vorbis overlap discard and positive/negative per-lace DiscardPadding.",
    "Content encodings support the pinned FFmpeg profile: zlib, LZO1X and header stripping in packet/private scopes. Original build has no bzip2 support; original private-header failures are retained.",
    "Actual native FFmpegGENERIC Vorbis output is float32 exact. Opus uses the separately qualified native libopus1.3.1 float profile; resampled PCM is within1LSB of that codec reference. Original FFmpegGENERIC/host decoder outputs are retained independently and may differ, especially on Opus voip.",
    "Common stream/path frontend returns normalized float32 and preserves caller stream ownership. Codec INVALIDDATA retains prior PCM and stops at the original closed-generator boundary.",
    "No AAC/MP3/FLAC/PCM Matroska route, trained Matroska transcription trace, all malformed EBML cases or universal CPU arithmetic claim. Other containers and pure Whisper engine have separate evidence."
  ],
  "status": "Public consumed Opus/Vorbis route; four canonical guarded checks pass on both interpreters. Original FFmpeg Opus PCM differences remain open."
}
